OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after couple
OL,4,Aand two children die in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "multiple murder" investigation has
OL,7,Fbegun after four people, including two
OL,8,Fchildren, died in an arson attack on
OL,9,Ftheir family home in County Waterford.
OL,11,FGardai (Irish police) confirmed that a
OL,12,Fman, a woman and two of their children
OL,13,Fdied in the fire at a house on Birch
OL,14,FAvenue, on the outskirts of Waterford
OL,15,Fcity.
OL,17,FThe parents have been named locally as
OL,18,FPhilip and Kim English.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
